'''Aqua''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

== Appearance ==
Aqua’s blade and guard use an aqua-textured blue color, hence the name. The handle is solid black with blue tints.

